            "summary": "Graham's latest narrative update leaves its fair value estimate steady at $69.25 per share, even as expectations around growth and risk shift in response to recent performance. A slightly lower discount rate and modestly reduced revenue growth outlook capture the push and pull between strong execution, a healthy order book, and rising caution after a sharp share price run. Read on to see how you can track these evolving assumptions and stay updated on the changing story behind Graham's...",
